---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="页面不存在 — 参伍引擎"
  description="这个页面不存在。可以从首页、开发指南或 GitHub 继续浏览。"
  locale="auto"
  zhPath="/"
  enPath="/en/"
>
  <script is:inline>
    if (document.documentElement.dataset.locale === "en") {
      const title = "Page not found — Canwu Engine";
      const description = "This page does not exist. Continue from the home page, the guides, or GitHub.";
      document.title = title;
      document.querySelector('meta[name="description"]')?.setAttribute("content", description);
      document.querySelector('meta[property="og:title"]')?.setAttribute("content", title);
      document.querySelector('meta[property="og:description"]')?.setAttribute("content", description);
      document.querySelector('meta[name="twitter:title"]')?.setAttribute("content", title);
      document.querySelector('meta[name="twitter:description"]')?.setAttribute("content", description);
    }
  </script>

  <section class="not-found page-width" data-locale-content="zh-CN">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 · 页面不存在</p>
    <h1>找不到这个页面</h1>
    <p>链接可能已过期或有拼写错误。可以回到首页或开发指南继续浏览；如果是站内链接失效，欢迎在 GitHub 上报告。</p>
    <div class="action-row">
      <a class="button primary" href="/">返回首页</a>
      <a class="button" href="/developer/">查看开发指南 →</a>
      <a class="text-action" href="https://github.com/PeiyuanQi/canwu/issues">报告失效链接 ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="not-found page-width" data-locale-content="en">
    <p class="eyebrow">404 · Page not found</p>
    <h1>This page doesn&apos;t exist</h1>
    <p>The link may be outdated or mistyped. Go back to the home page or the guides, or report a broken link on GitHub.</p>
    <div class="action-row">
      <a class="button primary" href="/en/">Return home</a>
      <a class="button" href="/en/developer/">Read the guides →</a>
      <a class="text-action" href="https://github.com/PeiyuanQi/canwu/issues">Report a broken link ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
